With several sources and GPU code, the driver first writes each source's
merk module as merk bytecode, for each GPU and each kind of device compile
the program has, as that compile makes it but without copying other
modules' procedures (-fno-copy-device-procedures). Each device compile then
copies what its code reaches of the other modules from them
(-device-module-dir), as it copies the library's.

RUN: merkc -### -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=gfx1030 -O2 %S/Inputs/sumsq.m %S/Inputs/empty-main.m -o prog 2>&1 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %s
CHECK:      "-fc1" "-emit-merk-bc" "-fno-copy-device-procedures" "-fprocess-declarations" "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-O2" "-fprocess-kernels" "-o" "[[DIR:[^"]*merk-modules-gfx1030-processes[^"]*]]/sumsq.merkbc" "{{[^"]*}}sumsq.m"{{$}}
CHECK-NEXT: "-fc1" "-emit-merk-bc" "-fno-copy-device-procedures" "-fprocess-declarations" "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-O2" "-fprocess-kernels" "-o" "[[DIR]]/empty-main.merkbc" "{{[^"]*}}empty-main.m"{{$}}
CHECK-NEXT: "-fc1" "-emit-llvm-bc" "-fprocess-declarations" "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-O2" "-fprocess-kernels" "-device-module-dir" "[[DIR]]" "-o" "{{[^"]*}}sumsq-gfx1030-processes-{{[^"]*}}.o" "{{[^"]*}}sumsq.m"{{$}}
CHECK:      "-fc1" "-emit-llvm-bc" "-fprocess-declarations" "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-O2" "-fprocess-kernels" "-device-module-dir" "[[DIR]]" "-o" "{{[^"]*}}empty-main-gfx1030-processes-{{[^"]*}}.o" "{{[^"]*}}empty-main.m"{{$}}

With OpenMP as well, target regions' compiles get a directory of their own,
written as an OpenMP device compile makes the modules; and each GPU has its
own.

RUN: merkc -### -fopenmp -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=gfx1030,gfx90a %S/Inputs/sumsq.m %S/Inputs/empty-main.m -o prog 2>&1 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=OMP
OMP:      "-fc1" "-emit-merk-bc" "-fno-copy-device-procedures" "-fprocess-declarations" "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-fprocess-kernels" "-fprocess-loops" "-o" "[[P1030:[^"]*merk-modules-gfx1030-processes[^"]*]]/sumsq.merkbc" "{{[^"]*}}sumsq.m"{{$}}
OMP-NEXT: "-fc1" "-emit-merk-bc" "-fno-copy-device-procedures" "-fprocess-declarations" "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-fprocess-kernels" "-fprocess-loops" "-o" "[[P1030]]/empty-main.merkbc" "{{[^"]*}}empty-main.m"{{$}}
OMP-NEXT: "-fc1" "-emit-merk-bc" "-fno-copy-device-procedures" "-fopenmp" "-fprocess-declarations" "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-fopenmp-is-target-device" "-o" "[[O1030:[^"]*merk-modules-gfx1030[^"]*]]/sumsq.merkbc" "{{[^"]*}}sumsq.m"{{$}}
OMP-NEXT: "-fc1" "-emit-merk-bc" "-fno-copy-device-procedures" "-fopenmp" "-fprocess-declarations" "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-fopenmp-is-target-device" "-o" "[[O1030]]/empty-main.merkbc" "{{[^"]*}}empty-main.m"{{$}}
OMP-NEXT: "-fc1" "-emit-merk-bc" {{.*}} "-triple" "amdgpu9.0a-amd-amdhsa" "-fprocess-kernels" "-fgpu-process-waves=2" "-fgpu-process-no-callee-saved" "-fprocess-loops" "-o" "[[P90A:[^"]*merk-modules-gfx90a-processes[^"]*]]/sumsq.merkbc" "{{[^"]*}}sumsq.m"{{$}}
OMP:      "-fc1" "-emit-merk-bc" {{.*}} "-triple" "amdgpu9.0a-amd-amdhsa" "-fopenmp-is-target-device" "-o" "[[O90A:[^"]*merk-modules-gfx90a[^"]*]]/empty-main.merkbc" "{{[^"]*}}empty-main.m"{{$}}
OMP:      "-fc1" "-emit-llvm-bc" {{.*}} "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-fprocess-kernels" "-fprocess-loops" "-device-module-dir" "[[P1030]]" "-o"
OMP:      "-fc1" "-emit-llvm-bc" {{.*}} "-triple" "amdgpu9.0a-amd-amdhsa" "-fprocess-kernels" "-fgpu-process-waves=2" "-fgpu-process-no-callee-saved" "-fprocess-loops" "-device-module-dir" "[[P90A]]" "-o"
OMP:      "-fc1" "-emit-llvm-bc" {{.*}} "-triple" "amdgpu10.30-amd-amdhsa" "-device-module-dir" "[[O1030]]" "-fopenmp-is-target-device"
OMP:      "-fc1" "-emit-llvm-bc" {{.*}} "-triple" "amdgpu9.0a-amd-amdhsa" "-device-module-dir" "[[O90A]]" "-fopenmp-is-target-device"

One source, or no GPU code, needs none.

RUN: merkc -### -fopenmp -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=gfx1030 %S/Inputs/sumsq.m -o prog 2>&1 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NONE --implicit-check-not=-emit-merk-bc --implicit-check-not=-device-module-dir
RUN: merkc -### -fopenmp -fprocess-declarations %S/Inputs/sumsq.m %S/Inputs/empty-main.m -o prog 2>&1 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NONE --implicit-check-not=-emit-merk-bc --implicit-check-not=-device-module-dir
NONE: "-fc1"
